        526.606201171875,
        540.0775146484375
      ],
      "text": "ranked by decreasing order of usual preference for use, subject to other considerations. The 2018 IPD meta-analysis for longer regimens",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        540.5735473632812,
        526.666015625,
        551.0775146484375
      ],
      "text": "included no patients on thioacetazone and too few patients on gatifloxacin and high-dose isoniazid for a meaningful analysis. No",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        551.5735473632812,
        526.6144409179688,
        562.0775146484375
      ],
      "text": "recommendation on perchlozone, interferon gamma or sutezolid was possible owing to the absence of final patient treatment outcome",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        562.5735473632812,
        221.3591766357422,
        573.0775146484375
      ],
      "text": "data from appropriate studies (see Annex 6).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        576.4082641601562,
        526.6162719726562,
        586.9122314453125
      ],
      "text": "Bedaquiline is usually administered at 400 mg orally once daily for the first 2 weeks, followed by 200 mg orally three times per week for  b",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        587.408203125,
        526.6065063476562,
        597.9121704101562
      ],
      "text": "22 weeks (total duration of 24 weeks). As a result of multiple reviews as new data have gradually become available, the use of bedaquiline",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        598.408203125,
        526.7274169921875,
        608.9121704101562
      ],
      "text": "is no longer restricted by the age of the patient. Evidence on the safety and effectiveness of bedaquiline use beyond 6 months was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        609.408203125,
        526.6101684570312,
        619.9121704101562
      ],
      "text": "insufficient for review in 2018. Therefore, the use of bedaquiline beyond 6 months was implemented following best practices in “off-label”",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        619.4801635742188,
        526.5706787109375,
        630.9121704101562
      ],
      "text": "(79).  use  New evidence on the safety profile of bedaquiline use beyond 6 months was available to the GDG 2019, but the GDG was not",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        631.408203125,
        526.6182250976562,
        641.9121704101562
      ],
      "text": "able to assess the impact of prolonged bedaquiline use on efficacy, owing to the limited evidence and potential residual confounding in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        642.408203125,
        526.6159057617188,
        652.9121704101562
      ],
      "text": "the data. However, the evidence supports the safe use of bedaquiline beyond 6 months in patients who receive appropriate schedules of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        653.408203125,
        526.5636596679688,
        663.9121704101562
      ],
      "text": "baseline and follow-up monitoring. The use of bedaquiline beyond 6 months remains as off-label use and, in this regard, best practices",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        664.408203125,
        155.7908935546875,
        674.9121704101562
      ],
      "text": "in off-label use still apply.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        678.2428588867188,
        526.7395629882812,
        688.746826171875
      ],
      "text": "Evidence on the concurrent use of bedaquiline and delamanid was insufficient for review in 2018. In 2019, new evidence on the concurrent  c",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 7.98784065246582,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        689.2428588867188,
        526.7759399414062,
        699.746826171875
      ],
      "text": "use of bedaquiline and delamanid was made available to the GDG. Regarding safety, the GDG concluded that the data suggest no",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        700.2428588867188,
        526.6000366210938,
        710.746826171875
      ],
      "text": "additional safety concerns regarding concurrent use of bedaquiline and delamanid. Both medicines may be used concurrently in patients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        711.2428588867188,
        526.6039428710938,
        721.746826171875
      ],
      "text": "who have limited other treatment options available to them, provided that sufficient monitoring (including baseline and follow-up ECG",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        722.2428588867188,
        526.6103515625,
        732.746826171875
      ],
      "text": "and electrolyte monitoring) is in place. The data on the effectiveness of concurrent use of bedaquiline and delamanid were reviewed by",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        733.2428588867188,
        526.57421875,
        743.746826171875
      ],
      "text": "the GDG; however, owing to the limited evidence and potential residual confounding in the data, the GDG was unable to proceed with a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
